# 登录接口会通过响应脚本自动保存 userToken、adminToken 和 opsToken。
# 后端每次重启后，都需要重新执行第2、3、4步生成新令牌。
# 第8步创建订单成功后会自动保存 orderId。

### 1. 健康检查：确认后端已经启动
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/system/health

### 2. 普通用户模拟登录：成功后自动保存 userToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "模块开发人员",
  "accountType": "USER"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("userToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 3. 管理员模拟登录：成功后自动保存 adminToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "资源管理员",
  "accountType": "ADMIN"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 4. 运维人员模拟登录：成功后自动保存 opsToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "审计运维",
  "accountType": "OPS"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("opsToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 5. 查询已上架资源列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/resources?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6. 查询资源详情：将5替换为资源列表中的真实 resourceId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/resources/5
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 7. 查询SKU库存：将5替换为资源详情中的真实 skuId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/resource-skus/5/availability?date=2026-07-30&timeSlot=
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. 创建订单：每次创建新订单都必须使用新的 Idempotency-Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-order-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": 5,
      "quantity": 1,
      "serviceDate": "2026-07-30",
      "timeSlot": "",
      "businessData": {
        "visitors": [
          {
            "name": "张三",
            "mobile": "13800138000",
            "idType": "ID_CARD",
            "idNo": "110101199001011234"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "remark": "模块联调订单"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("orderId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 9. 查询我的订单列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10. 查询订单详情：使用第8步自动保存的 orderId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 11. 模拟支付：只允许支付未过期的待支付订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-payment-001

### 12. 查询已支付订单的电子票
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 13. 查询订单完整时间线：包含创建、支付、退款和核销事件
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/timeline
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 14. 模拟退款：仅用于已支付且电子票尚未核销的订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/mock-refund
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-refund-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "模块联调退款"
}

### 15. 管理员查询全部订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 16. 管理员查询指定订单详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. 管理员手动扫描超时未支付订单：系统每分钟也会自动扫描
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/orders/expire-overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. 管理员下架资源：测试完成后务必执行第19步恢复上架
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/resources/5/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 19. 管理员恢复资源上架
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/resources/5/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 20. 管理员减少一份库存：库存记录ID不是skuId，请使用数据库中的真实 inventoryId
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/inventories/5/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-inventory-adjust-down-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": -1,
  "remark": "联调测试减少库存"
}

### 21. 管理员恢复一份库存：必须使用新的 Idempotency-Key
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/inventories/5/adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-inventory-adjust-up-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delta": 1,
  "remark": "联调测试恢复库存"
}

### 22. 管理员核销电子票：将核销码替换为第12步返回的 data[0].code
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/verifications/consume
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "请粘贴电子票核销码"
}

### 23. 运维人员查询审计日志
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ops/audit-logs?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{opsToken}}

### 24. 查询景区订单的脱敏游客信息：使用第8步自动保存的 orderId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/scenic/orders/{{orderId}}/visitors
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 25. 查询文旅景区列表：自动保存第一个景区ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/scenic-spots?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

> {%
    client.global.set("scenicSpotId", response.body.data.items[0].id);
%}

### 26. 查询景区详情：使用第25步自动保存的景区ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/scenic-spots/{{scenicSpotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 27. 查询今天可预订的票种：自动生成今天日期并保存第一个SKU ID
< {%
    const now = new Date();
    const year = now.getFullYear();
    const month = String(now.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, "0");
    const day = String(now.getDate()).padStart(2, "0");
    const serviceDate = `${year}-${month}-${day}`;
    request.variables.set("scenicServiceDate", serviceDate);
    client.global.set("scenicServiceDate", serviceDate);
%}
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/scenic-spots/{{scenicSpotId}}/tickets?serviceDate={{scenicServiceDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

> {%
    client.global.set("scenicSkuId", response.body.data[0].skuId);
%}

### 28. 创建景区门票订单：实名游客数量必须与购票数量一致
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: scenic-order-{{$timestamp}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": {{scenicSkuId}},
      "quantity": 1,
      "serviceDate": "{{scenicServiceDate}}",
      "timeSlot": "",
      "businessData": {
        "visitors": [
          {
            "name": "殷子聪",
            "mobile": "13800138000",
            "idType": "ID_CARD",
            "idNo": "150204199001011234"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "remark": "文旅景区预订模块联调订单"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("scenicOrderId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 29. 模拟支付景区订单：成功后按购票数量生成电子票
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{scenicOrderId}}/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: scenic-payment-{{$timestamp}}

### 30. 查询景区电子票
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{scenicOrderId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 31. 查询景区订单脱敏游客信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/scenic/orders/{{scenicOrderId}}/visitors
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 32. 管理员新增景区儿童票：票种编码自动生成，成功后保存SKU ID
# 请先执行第3步管理员登录和第25步景区列表。
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/scenic-spots/{{scenicSpotId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuCode": "SCENIC_CHILD_{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "儿童票（联调）",
  "ticketType": "CHILD",
  "priceCent": 4000,
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "audienceRule": "适用于儿童游客，具体规则以运营配置为准",
  "usageRule": "仅限预约日期和预约时段使用",
  "refundRule": "未核销前可按平台规则申请退款",
  "entryNotice": "请按预约时段入园",
  "validDays": 1,
  "maxPerOrder": 5,
  "realNameRequired": false,
  "idCardRequired": false
}

> {%
    client.global.set("managedScenicSkuId", response.body.data.skuId);
%}

### 33. 管理员配置上午预约时段和限流库存
# 已有订单时，totalQuantity不能小于已预订数量；不会覆盖已经锁定的名额。
< {%
    const now = new Date();
    const year = now.getFullYear();
    const month = String(now.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, "0");
    const day = String(now.getDate()).padStart(2, "0");
    const serviceDate = `${year}-${month}-${day}`;
    request.variables.set("managedServiceDate", serviceDate);
    client.global.set("managedServiceDate", serviceDate);
%}
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/scenic-tickets/{{managedScenicSkuId}}/inventories/{{managedServiceDate}}?timeSlot=09:00-12:00
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: scenic-slot-{{$timestamp}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalQuantity": 50,
  "priceCent": 4000
}

### 34. 用户端验证新增票种和上午场库存
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/scenic-spots/{{scenicSpotId}}/tickets?serviceDate={{managedServiceDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 35. 管理员身份证核验入园：请先完成第28、29步，身份证号必须与下单游客一致
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/verifications/consume-by-id-card
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idNo": "150204199001011234"
}

### 36. 管理员新增景区项目套票：请先执行第3、25、27和32步
# 套票本身是独立可售SKU，价格、库存和限流均由套票自身控制。
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/scenic-spots/{{scenicSpotId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuCode": "SCENIC_PACKAGE_{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "景区双人联票（联调）",
  "ticketType": "PACKAGE",
  "priceCent": 10000,
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "audienceRule": "适用于双人或按组件数量分别入园的游客",
  "usageRule": "购买后按预约日期核销套票内各项目",
  "refundRule": "任一组件未核销前可按平台规则申请退款",
  "entryNotice": "请分别出示套票内各项目的电子票二维码",
  "validDays": 1,
  "maxPerOrder": 5,
  "realNameRequired": false,
  "idCardRequired": false
}

> {%
    client.global.set("packageSkuId", response.body.data.skuId);
%}

### 37. 管理员配置套票组件：至少两个普通景区票，不能嵌套套票
# scenicSkuId 由第27步保存；managedScenicSkuId 由第32步保存。
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/scenic-packages/{{packageSkuId}}/components
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "components": [
    {
      "skuId": {{scenicSkuId}},
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "skuId": {{managedScenicSkuId}},
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 38. 管理员设置套票当日库存与限流
# 套票库存独立于组件库存，运营人员须按最紧缺组件的接待能力设置总量。
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/scenic-tickets/{{packageSkuId}}/inventories/{{managedServiceDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: scenic-package-slot-{{$timestamp}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "totalQuantity": 20,
  "priceCent": 10000
}

### 39. 用户查询已上架的项目套票详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/scenic-packages/{{packageSkuId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 40. 用户创建项目套票订单：按套票SKU下单，不直接购买组件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: scenic-package-order-{{$timestamp}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": {{packageSkuId}},
      "quantity": 1,
      "serviceDate": "{{managedServiceDate}}",
      "timeSlot": ""
    }
  ],
  "remark": "景区项目套票联调订单"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("packageOrderId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 41. 模拟支付项目套票：支付后按组件生成多张可独立核销的电子票
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{packageOrderId}}/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: scenic-package-payment-{{$timestamp}}

### 42. 查询项目套票电子票：应返回每个组件各自的电子票和二维码
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{packageOrderId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 43. 管理员查询景区运营概览：售票按游玩日期，入园按实际核销日期
# 请先完成第3、25、28—30和35步；金额单位为分，verificationRate为百分比。
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/scenic-spots/{{scenicSpotId}}/operations/summary?startDate={{managedServiceDate}}&endDate={{managedServiceDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 44. 管理员分页查询景区核销记录：不返回游客身份证和核销码
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/scenic-spots/{{scenicSpotId}}/operations/verification-records?startDate={{managedServiceDate}}&endDate={{managedServiceDate}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
